## Why This Is Asked
This tests cross-DC identity, trust propagation, and gateway policy in a real-world Consul Connect setup.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-data-center federation, SPIFFE IDs, mTLS; CA trust propagation; mesh gateway policies; TLS handshake troubleshooting across DCs; rollback.

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example: parse envoy TLS error from logs and map to SPIFFE ID
function mapTlsError(line){
  if(line.includes('certificate verify failed')){ return 'trust issue';}
  if(line.includes('unknown issuer')){ return 'issuer issue';}
  return 'unknown';
}
```

